","name":"M163火神防空车","type":"炮兵","cost":2,"operation_cost":1,"attack":1,"defense":3,"rarity":"普通","effect":"主动攻击空中单位时，本次战斗攻击+2。","historical_anchor":"冷战自行高炮；保留低效对地能力。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-18","faction":"美国/北约","name":"爱国者防空连","type":"炮兵","cost":4,"operation_cost":1,"attack":2,"defense":5,"rarity":"限定","effect":"只能主动攻击空中单位。每个敌方回合首次有敌方飞机攻击本单位以外的友方单位时，在战斗前对攻击者造成1点效果伤害。","historical_anchor":"冷战末期防空系统；不套用现代PAC-3。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-19","faction":"美国/北约","name":"F-16C战隼","type":"战斗机","cost":4,"operation_cost":1,"attack":3,"defense":4,"rarity":"普通","effect":"部署：锁定一支敌方地面单位。","historical_anchor":"采用Block 30/40时代能力。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-20","faction":"美国/北约","name":"F-15C鹰","type":"战斗机","cost":6,"operation_cost":2,"attack":5,"defense":5,"rarity":"特殊","effect":"部署：对一支敌方空中单位造成3点伤害。","historical_anchor":"1979年起进入装备序列的制空型号。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-21","faction":"美国/北约","name":"F/A-18C大黄蜂","type":"战斗机","cost":5,"operation_cost":2,"attack":4,"defense":4,"rarity":"限定","effect":"闪击。主动攻击被锁定单位时，本次战斗攻击+1。","historical_anchor":"冷战末期舰载多用途战斗机。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-22","faction":"美国/北约","name":"狂风F3","type":"战斗机","cost":5,"operation_cost":1,"attack":3,"defense":5,"rarity":"限定","effect":"敌方回合期间，攻击+2。","historical_anchor":"英国冷战末期防空拦截型，区别于GR1。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-23","faction":"美国/北约","name":"A-10A雷电II","type":"轰炸机","cost":5,"operation_cost":2,"attack":3,"defense":5,"rarity":"普通","effect":"重甲1。主动攻击坦克时，本次战斗攻击+2。","historical_anchor":"近距支援攻击机，按对地兵种归类；不是A-10C。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-24","faction":"美国/北约","name":"F-117A夜鹰","type":"轰炸机","cost":7,"operation_cost":2,"attack":5,"defense":4,"rarity":"精英","effect":"烟幕。部署：对一支被锁定的敌方地面单位造成3点伤害。","historical_anchor":"1983年形成初始作战能力；F编号不代表制空用途。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-25","faction":"美国/北约","name":"柏林空运","type":"指令","cost":2,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"抽2张牌。","historical_anchor":"1948—1949年向西柏林实施空运补给。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-26","faction":"美国/北约","name":"仁川登陆","type":"指令","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"在己方支援阵线添加两支「陆战先遣队」。若己方控制前线，它们获得闪击。","historical_anchor":"1950年仁川登陆；闪击奖励为玩法抽象。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-27","faction":"美国/北约","name":"镍草行动","type":"指令","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"一支友方单位永久获得+1/+2。抽1张牌。","historical_anchor":"1973年美国向以色列空运补给；以色列不是北约成员。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-28","faction":"美国/北约","name":"返德增援","type":"指令","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"指挥点容量+1，但不补充当前可用指挥点。下个己方回合正常抽牌后额外抽1张。","historical_anchor":"REFORGER系列演习，1969年起。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-29","faction":"美国/北约","name":"空地一体战","type":"指令","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"限定","effect":"选择一支友方地面单位和一支友方空中单位：它们永久获得+1/+1，且本回合行动费-1，最低0。必须同时有两类合法目标。","historical_anchor":"1982年FM 100-5条令；属于军事学说。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-30","faction":"美国/北约","name":"沙漠盾牌","type":"指令","cost":4,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"在己方支援阵线添加两支「战备守军」，修复己方总部3点防御。","historical_anchor":"1990年防御部署；不混同1991年沙漠风暴。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-31","faction":"美国/北约","name":"ATACMS Block I","type":"指令","cost":4,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"限定","effect":"对一支敌方地面单位造成4点伤害；若其被锁定，改为6点。","historical_anchor":"1990年8月提前部署，首次实战在1991年；战术导弹。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-32","faction":"美国/北约","name":"洛杉矶级：海上遮断","type":"指令","cost":5,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"特殊","effect":"对一支敌方地面单位造成5点伤害。敌方下回合使用的第一张指令费用+1。","historical_anchor":"核动力攻击潜艇的常规作战抽象；不是核爆攻击。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-33","faction":"美国/北约","name":"KH-9轨道侦察","type":"指令","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"限定","effect":"情报2。锁定至多两支敌方单位。抽1张牌。","historical_anchor":"HEXAGON照相侦察卫星，1971年起；即时效果为游戏抽象。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-34","faction":"美国/北约","name":"GPS Block II导航","type":"指令","cost":2,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"锁定一支敌方单位。选择一支友方单位，其本回合主动攻击该目标时无视重甲。抽1张牌。必须同时有两方单位。","historical_anchor":"1989年起部署Block II；不是轨道打击武器。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-35","faction":"美国/北约","name":"「镜盾」心灵干扰","type":"指令","cost":4,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"精英","effect":"一支敌方单位攻击-3，最低0，持续至其控制者下回合结束。抽1张牌。","historical_anchor":"原创架空心灵对抗协议。","fictional":true,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-36","faction":"美国/北约","name":"北约双轨决策","type":"指令","cost":5,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"特殊","effect":"对一支敌方单位造成3点伤害。指挥点容量+1，但不补充当前可用指挥点。","historical_anchor":"1979年部署与军控谈判并行的决策；效果为战略压力抽象。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-37","faction":"美国/北约","name":"古巴海上隔离","type":"反制","cost":2,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"敌方从手中部署印刷费用至少5且有部署效果的单位时，在部署效果执行前取消该效果，然后抽1张牌。该单位仍留在场上。","historical_anchor":"1962年古巴导弹危机中的美国海上隔离行动。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-38","faction":"美国/北约","name":"鹰爪：紧急撤离","type":"反制","cost":2,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"限定","effect":"敌方单位宣布攻击友方单位时，在战斗前将被攻击单位返回你的手牌，取消此次战斗。","historical_anchor":"1980年鹰爪行动中止与撤离；不暗示行动成功。","fictional":false,"alternate_timeline":false},{"id":"N-39","faction":"美国/北约","name":"优秀射手警戒","type":"反制","cost":3,"operation_cost":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"rarity":"普通","effect":"敌方空中单位宣布攻击时，在战斗前对攻击者造成3点伤害。","historical_anchor":"1983年Able Archer演习；警戒效果为游戏抽象。"